1495
01:07:04.760 --> 01:07:06.046
LLOYD: Hey,
wait a minute!

1496
01:07:06.680 --> 01:07:09.047
What about
the old Stinkeroo?

1497
01:07:09.280 --> 01:07:11.203
(SIGHS) Yeah, I'm in.
(CHUCKLES)

1498
01:07:23.240 --> 01:07:24.651
(SCRATCHING)

1499
01:07:29.360 --> 01:07:30.566
