1500
01:07:30.640 --> 01:07:32.369
Excuse me, ma'am.
Yes?

1501
01:07:32.480 --> 01:07:33.641
This beer smells funky.

1502
01:07:33.720 --> 01:07:35.006
Can I have
a new one, please?

1503
01:07:35.640 --> 01:07:36.721
