2158
01:35:12.120 --> 01:35:13.849
Better not be my heart.
DOCTOR: No.

2159
01:35:14.680 --> 01:35:17.126
I believe it's a pork chop.

2160
01:35:17.480 --> 01:35:19.005
In a baggie.
(CHUCKLING)

2161
01:35:20.080 --> 01:35:23.527
